{"seq":31,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1016"},"reason":"The underworld paragraph now names the second famous river, Lethe ('oblivion'), with Plato's myth of Er, and the table gains its row, so the new Lethe question has its sentence.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",752],["+","A second river, Lethe, whose name means \"oblivion\", took the memory of the dead: whoever drank from it forgot his earthly life, and in the myth of Er that closes Plato's \"Republic\", written around 375 BC, the souls waiting to be born again cross the barren \"plain of Lethe\" and drink from its river before they return to earth. "],["=",246],["+","Lethe | River of forgetfulness | Underworld |\n| "],["=",57]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",716],["+","Ein zweiter Fluss, Lethe, dessen Name „Vergessen“ bedeutet, nahm den Toten die Erinnerung: Wer aus ihm trank, vergaß sein irdisches Leben, und im Mythos von Er am Schluss von Platons „Politeia“, geschrieben um 375 v. Chr., durchqueren die Seelen, die auf ihre Wiedergeburt warten, die öde „Ebene der Lethe“ und trinken aus ihrem Fluss, bevor sie auf die Erde zurückkehren. "],["=",244],["+","Lethe | Fluss des Vergessens | Unterwelt |\n| "],["=",57]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",642],["+","Вторая река, Лета, чьё имя означает «забвение», отнимала у мёртвых память: кто пил из неё, забывал свою земную жизнь, а в мифе об Эре, завершающем «Государство» Платона, написанное около 375 года до н. э., души, ожидающие нового рождения, пересекают пустынную «равнину Леты» и пьют из её реки, прежде чем вернуться на землю. "],["=",216],["+","Лета | река забвения | подземный мир |\n| "],["=",53]]}],"hash":"b1032164adb3"},
{"seq":32,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"marked","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f05080"},"reason":"Answer marks moved with the text inserted into the article body for the new fact f28505.","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"spans","old":{"en":[2212,8],"de":[2420,8],"ru":[2155,6]},"new":{"en":[2540,8],"de":[2793,8],"ru":[2480,6]}}],"hash":"2dae57a1ab29"},
{"seq":33,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28505"},"reason":"New question on Lethe, the river of forgetfulness and the best-known underworld river after the Styx that the sacred map lacked; verified on Wikipedia's Lethe article (drinking brings complete forgetfulness; the 'plain of Lethe' in the myth of Er in Book X of Plato's Republic).","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lethe"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Myth_of_Er"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Lethe"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Lethe"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"Лета"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[2158,5],"de":[2359,5],"ru":[2102,4]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"creation","start":"-375","end":null,"precision":"year","approx":true,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"Plato's myth of Er leads the souls across the „plain of Lethe“ before rebirth","labelDe":"Platons Mythos von Er führt die Seelen vor der Wiedergeburt über die „Ebene der Lethe“","labelRu":"В платоновском мифе об Эре души перед новым рождением пересекают «равнину Леты»"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lethe","title":"Lethe – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"c00925b35d91"},
{"seq":34,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w27505"},"reason":"Open question for the new fact: New question on Lethe, the river of forgetfulness and the best-known underworld river after the Styx that the sacred map lacked; verified on Wikipedia's Lethe article (drinking brings complete forgetfulness; the 'plain of Lethe' in the myth of Er in Book X of Plato's Republic).","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"Which river of the Greek underworld made the dead forget their earthly lives when they drank from it?"},{"field":"de","new":"Welcher Fluss der griechischen Unterwelt ließ die Toten ihr irdisches Leben vergessen, wenn sie aus ihm tranken?"},{"field":"ru","new":"Какая река греческого подземного мира заставляла мёртвых забыть свою земную жизнь, если они пили из неё?"},{"field":"origin","new":"generated"},{"field":"fact","new":"f28505"}],"hash":"cacff24c61e6"},
